[h1] About[/h1]

Scientists never thought it could be done but they have been proven wrong.
Your trusty bolt action rifle can now be eaten for sustenance just remember to being a spare rifle otherwise you may become a wolfs next pray...
Breaking news!
We have created a new formula to allow you to snack on your ammo.
Call 1-800 EatYourGun to receive your very own gun modification kit to make your weapon your next meal.

[h1] Compatibility[/h1]

Any weapon that is classed as a Ranged Weapon via traditional means.
Melee weapons are also supported but provide no nutritional value due to them being already classed as a "Food.”
Anyone who is not allergic to gallium.
Anyone who is willing for their meal to taste like burnt rubber and chemfuel.

[h1] Actual Compatibility [/h1]
Any weapon that is classed as a ranged weapon or melee weapon
Melee weapons can be eaten but do not provide any nutritional value due to Rimworlds spaghetti code.
Combat Extended is supported

Ecotech Incompatible | The weapon lifetime system present in that mod is likely preventing the items from that mod from being consumed correctly.


Should be universally compatible with mods but some use lots of custom systems and features which may not play nicely with this mod
